Order of execution:
1. GRCA_SV_BayesNSGP.R with sampler_type = "RW_NN_GP".
2. GRCA_SV_BayesNSGP.R with sampler_type = "RW" (fresh R session, same machine, nothing else running, so that run times are comparable).
3. GRCA_compare_samplers.R.
4. GRCA_predictions_phi_f_BayesNSGP.R.

Computational note: the two long runs take [   ] and [   ] hours. For a quick test of the scripts, reduce mcmc_settings in GRCA_SV_BayesNSGP.R (for example niter = 2000, nburnin = 1000, thin = 10, thin2 = 20); the comparison script requires identical settings for both runs.
